<span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Hospital Wastewater</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"4212c44\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Optimize Your Water Management with the Latest Technology\",\"header_size\":\"div\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals/typography?id=secondary\",\"title_color\":\"globals/colors?id=accent\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e9ad051\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://suriota.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/SURIOTA-MODULE-WASTEWATER-LOGGER.png\",\"id\":1044,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"SURIOTA MODULE WASTEWATER LOGGER\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"8fd56ae\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Introducing the latest Wastewater Logger from Suriota, a powerful device that supports Modbus RS232, SDI-12, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth protocols for seamless integration. This logger enables real-time data monitoring, resource utilization optimization, and anomaly detection with ease.</p><p>With wireless connectivity, you can access and control this device remotely, ensuring more efficient and responsive water management.</p><p>Suriota's Wastewater Logger V.3 can take your water management to the next level. Increase operational efficiency and ensure environmental compliance with our innovative solution.</p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"2d96125\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-section sx-whyus sx-prod-features\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-whyus-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-eyebrow\\\">KEY FEATURES</span>\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sx-whyus-title\\\">Why operators choose Wastewater Logger</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"sx-whyus-grid\\\">\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">01</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Multi-Parameter Logging</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Logs <strong>pH, TDS, Flow, Pressure, Level</strong> via Modbus RS-485 sensor inputs. Configurable channels and sampling intervals.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">02</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">4G + WiFi Connectivity</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\"><strong>Cellular 4G LTE</strong> for remote sites, WiFi for local network. Auto-failover ensures continuous data upload.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">03</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">KLHK SPARING Ready</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Pre-configured for <strong>KLHK SPARING reporting</strong>. Compliance-ready effluent data submission per Permen LHK No. 80/2019.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">04</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Battery Backup + Cloud Sync</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Internal Li-ion battery keeps logging during outages. <strong>Cloud sync</strong> resumes automatically when power/network returns.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">05</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Multi-Protocol Sensor Support</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Supports <strong>Modbus RS232, SDI-12, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth</strong> for diverse sensor integration. Plus onboard temperature &amp; humidity sensors.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">06</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Solar Charging Compatible</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Built-in <strong>solar charging support</strong> with charging indicator and battery connector. Perfect for remote off-grid sites.</p></article>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"41df85f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"sx-action-group\\\">\\n  <a cl