ce-ready data submission with proper sampling intervals, parameter mapping, and government server integration out of the box.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>What sensors does it support?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">Supports pH, TDS, Conductivity, Flow, Pressure, Level via Modbus RS-485 inputs. Compatible with multi-brand sensors (Hach, Endress+Hauser, Krohne, Yokogawa). Configurable channels and sampling intervals per site.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>Does it work without continuous internet?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">Yes. Internal Li-ion battery keeps logging during power outages. Local storage buffers data when network is unavailable. Cloud sync resumes automatically when power and connectivity are restored.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>What connectivity options are available?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">4G LTE cellular for remote sites + WiFi 2.4GHz for local network. Auto-failover ensures continuous data upload. SIM card slot accepts any Indonesian carrier (Telkomsel, XL, Indosat, Smartfren).</div></details>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n<script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">\\n{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Is the logger KLHK SPARING ready?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Pre-configured for KLHK SPARING reporting per Permen LHK No. 80/2019. Compliance-ready out of the box.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What sensors does it support?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"pH, TDS, Conductivity, Flow, Pressure, Level via Modbus RS-485. Multi-brand compatible (Hach, E+H, Krohne, Yokogawa).\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Does it work without internet?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Internal Li-ion battery + local logging during outages. Cloud sync resumes when connectivity returns.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What connectivity options?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"4G LTE + WiFi 2.4GHz with auto-failover. SIM slot accepts Telkomsel, XL, Indosat, Smartfren.\\\"}}\\n]}\\n</script>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"9c447a7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-cta-final\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"prod-cta-heading\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-cta-final-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-cta-eyebrow\\\">Get Started</span>\\n    <h2 id=\\\"prod-cta-heading\\\" class=\\\"sx-cta-final-title\\\">Ready to automate wastewater compliance?</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"sx-cta-final-sub\\\">Request a quote with KLHK SPARING setup plan. Our team responds within 24 hours with parameter mapping and reporting workflow.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"sx-cta-final-actions\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"sx-cta-final-btn sx-cta-final-btn--primary\\\" href=\\\"https://suriota.com/contact/\\\">Request Quote <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">→</span></a>\\n      <a class=\\\"sx-cta-final-btn sx-cta-final-btn--wa\\\" href=\\\"https://wa.me/6285835672476?text=Hi%20SURIOTA%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20Wastewater%20Logger\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" aria-label=\\\"Chat on WhatsApp\\\">\\n        <svg width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.